Subject: [RFC PATCH] Script for generating Documentation/dontdiff from .gitignore files.
Date: Sun, 14 Sep 2008 21:23:57 +0300
Message-Id: <1221416637-6259-1-git-send-email-eduard.munteanu@linux360.ro>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.5.6.1
In-Reply-To: <e2e108260809130052u454b6920h9745c27eb2f4b20c@mail.gmail.com>
References: <e2e108260809130052u454b6920h9745c27eb2f4b20c@mail.gmail.com>
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
